codex
The sandbox exposes a PID namespace without a matching `/proc/<pid>/exe`; Lean’s runtime therefore cannot compute `IO.appPath`. I found the exact failing runtime call. I’m adding a tiny evidence-side preload shim that supplies only the pinned Lean executable path—the value a normal `/proc` mount would return—so the required clean builds can run without modifying either generated or candidate sources.
apply patch
