      "rationale": "Simplification asserting that enumeration of an all-float sequence satisfies allFloatItems; this cross-function inductive fact is not a recurrence defining either function.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-1be94e05a1b1440cd44a316053a753efc65fc522fcdf2fd8218e40d546231a89",
      "start_line": 156,
      "text": "  rule allFloatItems(enumVS(VS:ValSeq, _:Int))\n    => true\n    requires allFloatVS(VS)\n    [simplification]"
    }
