+| 16 | 163–164 | `DEFINITION` | Complementary branch defining `orderedFirst`. |
+| 17 | 165–166 | `DEFINITION` | True branch defining `orderedSecond`. |
+| 18 | 167–168 | `DEFINITION` | Complementary branch defining `orderedSecond`. |
